        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kiki Preston, Prince George, Duke of Kent, George V, Queen Mary\n- Organizations: Happy Valley set\n- Roles: American socialite, Duke of Kent\n\nFacts:\n- Kiki Preston, née Alice Gwynne, was born in 1898 and died on December 23, 1946.\n- Prince George, Duke of Kent, born George Edward Alexander Edmund, was born on 20 December 1902 and died on 25 August 1942.\n- Kiki Preston was an American socialite and a member of the Happy Valley set.\n- Prince George, Duke of Kent, was the fourth son of George V of the United Kingdom and Queen Mary.\n- Kiki Preston was the alleged mother of a child born out of wedlock with Prince George, Duke of Kent.",
